# Frontend environment variables
#
# For LOCAL DEVELOPMENT: leave VITE_API_URL empty (or unset).
# The Vite dev server proxies /api/* to http://localhost:8000 automatically.
#
# For PRODUCTION BUILDS: set VITE_API_URL to the full base URL of your deployed backend.
# This value is baked into the static build at compile time — it is NOT a runtime secret.
#
# Example:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com/api/v1
#
# VITE_API_URL must NOT end with a trailing slash.
# VITE_API_URL must NOT contain the path prefix "/analyses" — that is appended by the client.

VITE_API_URL=
